00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.120
Things are lively again this year.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.470
All right, let's head to the 
shrine for New Year's prayers.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.370
Gotta get rid of any jinxes we've picked up.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:53.060
Yeah!

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.890
Think about it. With the year we've had, 
what with Teio being injured after the Derby,

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:58.880
and then what happened to 
McQueen in the Fall Tennoushou,

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:01.050
Japan Cup, and Arima Kinen...

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:05.240
And McQueen shocks us all 
by coming in second place!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:09.120
After seeing the look on her face, 
a little prayer couldn't hurt.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.000
Please don't remind me!

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:14.840
Happy New Year!

